{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19186","headline":"夏日寄宣武令狐相公 · 刘禹锡","name":"夏日寄宣武令狐相公","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"长忆梁王逸兴多，西园花尽兴如何。\n近来溽暑侵亭馆，应觉清谈胜绮罗。\n境入篇章高韵发，风穿号令衆心和。\n承明欲谒先相报，愿拂朝衣逐晓珂。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19186.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19186","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}